   ""
   "## Get it"
   ""
   "Put this folder under `~/.nodecode/cells/` (or tell the agent \"add a cell from"
   "this folder\") and it loads at the next boot."
   ""
   "## Set it up"
   ""
   "Nothing is required: the section starts out saying what it was built for."
   ""
   "- `{{key}}` — {{source-note}}"
   "- `interval_minutes` — how often it looks on its own (default {{interval}})."
   ""
   "## Use it"
   ""
   "- the `{{tool}}` tool reports what is new since the last call, and remembers it;"
   "- `/{{slug}}` is the same report, for the operator;"
